 "audition": [
  "album 0-5.0 s: the intro -- the flat line and the nudge on the felt, the F4 held into bar 2 over Dbmaj7: is it CALM (sure of himself), not sad?  Identifiable in 2 bars?",
  "album 5.0-10.0 s and 15.0-20.0 s: the trio (upright two-feel, brushes) under the Water Line: the swing reads human, the push chords on the swung and-of-4 are jazz, not lounge",
  "album 10.0-15.0 s, 20.0-25.0 s, 50.0-55.0 s: the V.O. windows (felt alone) against a stock voice: the lowercase V.O. sits on top; nothing moves under it",
  "album 30.0-40.0 s: the one Harmon line -- \"the night\", never a Miles quote; the chip triangle counter-line underneath: identity without toy",
  "album 40.0 s: the verdict F5 -> C6 on vibes + celesta: the Orb, an open fifth, no third, no F6 bell",
  "loop-x3-preview.mp3 at 60.00 s and 120.00 s: the seam b26 -> b3 (the ending bar's held C7sus rolls into Fm9)",
  "FIX 1 balance: album 15.0-25.0 s (A's 2nd statement, violas now with the cellos) and 25.0-45.0 s (B: strings and Harmon each +2 dB) -- still \"everything else asks leave to join\"? the strings the world far off, not a cushion under his feelings; the Harmon the night, not a feature"
 ],
